  _targetId: Enchente_BombasDesligadas
  _headline: "Casas de bombas param e a \xE1gua entra nos bairros"
  _headlineEn: Pump stations stop and water pours into town
  _body: "Sem energia e com os motores alagados, as bombas desligam. Seu Arnaldo
    trocou o t\xE1xi por um bote emprestado."
  _bodyEn: With no power and flooded motors, the pumps shut down. Seu Arnaldo swapped
    his taxi for a borrowed rowboat.
